  ('ancient-of-days', 'blake', '옛적부터 계신 이', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Letters_of_William_Blake%2C_page_34_%28The_Ancient_of_Days%29.jpeg/1280px-Letters_of_William_Blake%2C_page_34_%28The_Ancient_of_Days%29.jpeg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Letters_of_William_Blake%2C_page_34_%28The_Ancient_of_Days%29.jpeg/1280px-Letters_of_William_Blake%2C_page_34_%28The_Ancient_of_Days%29.jpeg', 'romanticism', '창조의 순간, 컴퍼스를 든 신의 형상을 담았다.', FALSE),
  ('oedipus-sphinx', 'moreau', '오이디푸스와 스핑크스', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Oedipus_and_the_Sphinx_MET_DP-14201-023.jpg/1280px-Oedipus_and_the_Sphinx_MET_DP-14201-023.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Oedipus_and_the_Sphinx_MET_DP-14201-023.jpg/1280px-Oedipus_and_the_Sphinx_MET_DP-14201-023.jpg', 'symbolism', '수수께끼를 내는 스핑크스와 마주한 오이디푸스의 긴장감.', FALSE),
  ('the-cyclops', 'redon', '키클롭스', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Odilon_Redon_-_The_Cyclops%2C_c._1914.jpg/1280px-Odilon_Redon_-_The_Cyclops%2C_c._1914.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Odilon_Redon_-_The_Cyclops%2C_c._1914.jpg/1280px-Odilon_Redon_-_The_Cyclops%2C_c._1914.jpg', 'symbolism', '거대한 외눈 괴물의 수줍은 듯한 시선이 기묘한 분위기를 만든다.', FALSE),
  ('the-cradle', 'morisot', '요람', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Berthe_Morisot_-_The_Cradle_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/1280px-Berthe_Morisot_-_The_Cradle_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Berthe_Morisot_-_The_Cradle_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/1280px-Berthe_Morisot_-_The_Cradle_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg', 'impressionism', '잠든 아이를 바라보는 어머니의 섬세한 시선을 담았다.', FALSE),
  ('among-sierra-nevada', 'bierstadt', '시에라네바다의 풍경', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Albert_Bierstadt_-_Among_the_Sierra_Nevada%2C_California_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/1280px-Albert_Bierstadt_-_Among_the_Sierra_Nevada%2C_California_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Albert_Bierstadt_-_Among_the_Sierra_Nevada%2C_California_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/1280px-Albert_Bierstadt_-_Among_the_Sierra_Nevada%2C_California_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg', 'romanticism', '실제보다 더 극적인 빛으로 서부 개척시대의 신화를 그렸다.', FALSE),
  ('niagara', 'church', '나이아가라 폭포', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Frederic_Edwin_Church_-_Niagara_Falls%2C_from_the_American_Side_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/1280px-Frederic_Edwin_Church_-_Niagara_Falls%2C_from_the_American_Side_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Frederic_Edwin_Church_-_Niagara_Falls%2C_from_the_American_Side_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/1280px-Frederic_Edwin_Church_-_Niagara_Falls%2C_from_the_American_Side_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg', 'romanticism', '당시 사람들이 그림 앞에서 실제 폭포 소리를 상상했다고 전해진다.', FALSE),
  ('self-portrait-vigee-lebrun', 'vigee-lebrun', '밀짚모자를 쓴 자화상', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Self-portrait_in_a_Straw_Hat_by_Elisabeth-Louise_Vig%C3%A9e-Lebrun.jpg/1280px-Self-portrait_in_a_Straw_Hat_by_Elisabeth-Louise_Vig%C3%A9e-Lebrun.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Self-portrait_in_a_Straw_Hat_by_Elisabeth-Louise_Vig%C3%A9e-Lebrun.jpg/1280px-Self-portrait_in_a_Straw_Hat_by_Elisabeth-Louise_Vig%C3%A9e-Lebrun.jpg', 'rococo', '여성 화가가 드물던 시대에 당당한 자신감을 담은 자화상.', FALSE),
  ('grand-canal', 'canaletto', '그랑 카날', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Ca%27_Rezzonico_-_Canal_Grande_da_Palazzo_Balbi_a_Rialto_C.1722_-_Canaletto.jpg/1280px-Ca%27_Rezzonico_-_Canal_Grande_da_Palazzo_Balbi_a_Rialto_C.1722_-_Canaletto.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Ca%27_Rezzonico_-_Canal_Grande_da_Palazzo_Balbi_a_Rialto_C.1722_-_Canaletto.jpg/1280px-Ca%27_Rezzonico_-_Canal_Grande_da_Palazzo_Balbi_a_Rialto_C.1722_-_Canaletto.jpg', 'rococo', '카메라 옵스큐라를 활용해 정확한 도시 풍경을 담았다고 전해진다.', FALSE),
  ('cafe-terrace-night', 'vangogh', '밤의 카페 테라스', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Van_Gogh_-_Terrasse_des_Caf%C3%A9s_an_der_Place_du_Forum_in_Arles_am_Abend1.jpeg/1280px-Van_Gogh_-_Terrasse_des_Caf%C3%A9s_an_der_Place_du_Forum_in_Arles_am_Abend1.jpeg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Van_Gogh_-_Terrasse_des_Caf%C3%A9s_an_der_Place_du_Forum_in_Arles_am_Abend1.jpeg/1280px-Van_Gogh_-_Terrasse_des_Caf%C3%A9s_an_der_Place_du_Forum_in_Arles_am_Abend1.jpeg', 'post-impressionism', '가스등 아래 노란빛과 밤하늘의 파란빛을 대비시킨 아를의 밤 풍경.', FALSE),
  ('still-life-lemons', 'zurbaran', '레몬, 오렌지, 장미가 있는 정물', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Francisco_de_Zurbar%C3%A1n_-_Still_Life_with_Lemons%2C_Oranges_and_a_Rose.jpg/1280px-Francisco_de_Zurbar%C3%A1n_-_Still_Life_with_Lemons%2C_Oranges_and_a_Rose.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Francisco_de_Zurbar%C3%A1n_-_Still_Life_with_Lemons%2C_Oranges_and_a_Rose.jpg/1280px-Francisco_de_Zurbar%C3%A1n_-_Still_Life_with_Lemons%2C_Oranges_and_a_Rose.jpg', 'baroque', '단순한 과일 배치만으로 명상적인 고요함을 자아낸다.', FALSE),
  ('assumption-virgin', 'titian', '성모 승천', 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/Tizian_041.jpg', 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/Tizian_041.jpg', 'renaissance', '거대한 제단화로, 수직으로 솟아오르는 역동적 구도가 특징이다.', FALSE),
  ('the-ambassadors', 'holbein', '대사들', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Hans_Holbein_the_Younger_-_The_Ambassadors_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/1280px-Hans_Holbein_the_Younger_-_The_Ambassadors_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Hans_Holbein_the_Younger_-_The_Ambassadors_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/1280px-Hans_Holbein_the_Younger_-_The_Ambassadors_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg', 'northern-renaissance', '하단의 왜곡된 해골은 특정 각도에서만 제대로 보인다.', FALSE),
  ('descent-from-cross', 'vanderweyden', '십자가에서 내려지는 그리스도', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/El_Descendimiento%2C_by_Rogier_van_der_Weyden%2C_from_Prado_in_Google_Earth.jpg/1280px-El_Descendimiento%2C_by_Rogier_van_der_Weyden%2C_from_Prado_in_Google_Earth.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/El_Descendimiento%2C_by_Rogier_van_der_Weyden%2C_from_Prado_in_Google_Earth.jpg/1280px-El_Descendimiento%2C_by_Rogier_van_der_Weyden%2C_from_Prado_in_Google_Earth.jpg', 'northern-renaissance', '인물들의 자세가 그리스도의 몸짓을 그대로 반복하며 슬픔을 증폭시킨다.', FALSE),
  ('the-ray', 'chardin', '가오리', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/La_Raie_-_Jean_Baptiste_Sim%C3%A9on_Chardin_-_Mus%C3%A9e_du_Louvre_Peintures_INV_3197.jpg/1280px-La_Raie_-_Jean_Baptiste_Sim%C3%A9on_Chardin_-_Mus%C3%A9e_du_Louvre_Peintures_INV_3197.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/La_Raie_-_Jean_Baptiste_Sim%C3%A9on_Chardin_-_Mus%C3%A9e_du_Louvre_Peintures_INV_3197.jpg/1280px-La_Raie_-_Jean_Baptiste_Sim%C3%A9on_Chardin_-_Mus%C3%A9e_du_Louvre_Peintures_INV_3197.jpg', 'rococo', '평범한 부엌 소재를 기괴하면서도 숭고하게 그려냈다.', FALSE),
  ('the-clubfoot', 'ribera', '안짱다리 소년', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/The_Clubfoot_by_Jusepe_de_Ribera_%282%29.jpg/1280px-The_Clubfoot_by_Jusepe_de_Ribera_%282%29.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/The_Clubfoot_by_Jusepe_de_Ribera_%282%29.jpg/1280px-The_Clubfoot_by_Jusepe_de_Ribera_%282%29.jpg', 'baroque', '장애가 있는 소년을 위엄 있게 그린 이례적인 초상.', FALSE),
  ('laughing-cavalier', 'hals', '웃음 짓는 기사', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Cavalier_soldier_Hals-1624x.jpg/1280px-Cavalier_soldier_Hals-1624x.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Cavalier_soldier_Hals-1624x.jpg/1280px-Cavalier_soldier_Hals-1624x.jpg', 'baroque', '실제로는 웃고 있지 않지만 콧수염의 각도 때문에 그렇게 불린다.', FALSE)
